---
description: Project init and local runtime workspace invariants
globs: "src/project/**/*.ts, src/core/paths.ts, src/core/config.ts, src/state/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---
- `.ai-orchestrator/` is the only project-local runtime/state root.
- Initialization is explicit, safe, idempotent, and Git-local via `.git/info/exclude`.
- History reset preserves project configuration and permissions.
- Stage validation happens before AI branch creation.
- Run-history deletion must respect the repository run lock.
